                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v11.0"&gt;ILSpy 11.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;The major news item of this release cycle is us porting ILSpy from WPF to Avalonia. With this port, ILSpy is now available on Linux and Mac in addition to Windows. Do note that there is no longer a WPF frontend, it was entirely removed in favor of the new Avalonia one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aside from this already major UI work, a few other long-standing UI features from our wish list made it into ILSpy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;File / Open from NuGet feed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;File / Open from running process (all platforms!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Window / Bookmarks (full-featured bookmarks implementation for the decompiled C# view)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;View / Options / Display / Show Omnibar (breadcrumb/search bar feature at the top of decompiled code)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A second focus area was improving the ilspycmd story for agentic development. Download numbers for our dotnet tool took off in the last quarter of 2025, and agents like Claude are the reason for that (downloads are now exceeding 70k/week). Given we are using Claude as well, we found a few areas lacking that needed improvement, especially to save on token spend:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4991777552" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3924" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3924/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3924"&gt;#3924&lt;/a&gt;: ilspycmd: add --member for single-member decompilation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4718765259" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3801" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3801/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3801"&gt;#3801&lt;/a&gt;: Fix &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4712188871" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3797" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3797/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3797"&gt;#3797&lt;/a&gt;: resolve ilspycmd -t type names with fuzzy matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5038825063" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3951" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3951/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3951"&gt;#3951&lt;/a&gt;: Add --dump-table metadata dump mode to ilspycmd&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together with &lt;a href="#3951"&gt;list/extract embedded resources, decompile BAML to XAML&lt;/a&gt; which shipped in 10.1, we now have a good set of optimized options for the most common scenarios in skills and tool calling available for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A part of this initiative was hardening:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4761445685" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3843" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3843/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3843"&gt;#3843&lt;/a&gt;: Bound XamarinCompressedFileLoader against crafted XALZ headers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4761395399" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3842" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3842/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3842"&gt;#3842&lt;/a&gt;: Bound WebCilFile section access against mapped-view length&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4761295787" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3841" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3841/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3841"&gt;#3841&lt;/a&gt;: Harden BAML reader against crafted-resource crashes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4761169648" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3840" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3840/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3840"&gt;#3840&lt;/a&gt;: Bound .rsrc resource-tree parsing against crafted input&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4759588790" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3838" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3838/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3838"&gt;#3838&lt;/a&gt;: Guard against OOB read when bundle signature is at file start&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The third pillar of this release is fixing long-standing annoyances and in general investing in tech debt, eg fuzzing our decompiler engine with NuGet packages. A lot (!) of the changes detailled in the release notes for &lt;a href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v11.0-preview1"&gt;preview 1&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/releases/tag/v11.0-rc"&gt;rc&lt;/a&gt; deal with exactly those many small to big improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Finally, we'd like to point out one retirement: the VS2017/2019 add-in has been removed, we continue to support VS2022-2026.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What is new since RC?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5114226894" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3976" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3976/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3976"&gt;#3976&lt;/a&gt;: Fix &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2971381049" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3451" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3451/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3451"&gt;#3451&lt;/a&gt;: qualify an explicit implementation as the type implements it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5101200803" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3971" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3971/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3971"&gt;#3971&lt;/a&gt;: Fix &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3212680863" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3510" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3510/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3510"&gt;#3510&lt;/a&gt;: keep exporting a project when a member cannot be decompiled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5098545512" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3969" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3969/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3969"&gt;#3969&lt;/a&gt;: Keep null-conditional LINQ chains in method syntax — &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/sailro/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/sailro"&gt;@sailro&lt;/a&gt;, thank you!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5100991369" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3970" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3970/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3970"&gt;#3970&lt;/a&gt;: Generate DecompilerSettings boilerplate from [DecompilerSetting] attributes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5096839106" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3967" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3967/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3967"&gt;#3967&lt;/a&gt;: Keep ref-returning switches as statements — &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/sailro/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/sailro"&gt;@sailro&lt;/a&gt;, thank you!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5038755974" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3950" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3950/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3950"&gt;#3950&lt;/a&gt;: Reconstruct nested deconstruction designations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5070950457" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3956" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3956/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3956"&gt;#3956&lt;/a&gt;: Fix &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5042801681" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3952" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3952/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3952"&gt;#3952&lt;/a&gt;: decompile VB.NET anonymous types and queries to valid C#&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5084944643" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3959" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3959/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3959"&gt;#3959&lt;/a&gt;: Fix overflow approximating fractions of large negative constants&lt;/li&gt;
