&lt;li&gt;PR &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5069633800" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3955" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3955/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/pull/3955"&gt;#3955&lt;/a&gt;: Fix &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5068967215" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3954" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3954/hovercard" href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/issues/3954"&gt;#3954&lt;/a&gt;: name the entry point of a top-level program 'Main'&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For a full list of changes click &lt;a href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/compare/v10.1...v11.0"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release is based on &lt;a href="https://dotnet.microsoft.com/en-us/download/dotnet/10.0" rel="nofollow"&gt;.NET 10.0&lt;/a&gt;. Please make sure that you have it installed on your machine beforehand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note for Mac users: see &lt;a href="https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/wiki/Build-Artifacts#running-the-macos-artifact"&gt;https://github.com/icsharpcode/ILSpy/wiki/Build-Artifacts#running-the-macos-artifact&lt;/a&gt; because the ILSpy.app is neither signed nor notarized.&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
